{"id":"645ee8d3e395cd8f","group":"92","path":"92/92-fact-consistency-pi1.md","title":"fact-consistency-pi1 — The Selected Consistency Sentence Is Pi 1","display":"fact-consistency-pi1 — The Selected Consistency Sentence Is Pi_1","type":"fact","metadata":{"type":"fact","book":"Gödel's Incompleteness Theorems","book_abbrev":"92","label":"92-fact-consistency-pi1","aliases":["92-fact-consistency-pi1"],"display":"fact-consistency-pi1 — The Selected Consistency Sentence Is Pi_1","source":"第 IX 章 p. 108（PDF 125）；层级按本地定义","source_status":"原书内容的显式重构","depends_on":["[[92-df-consistency-statement]]","[[92-df-pi1-formula]]","[[92-fact-provability-sigma1]]","[[92-df-formula-instance]]","[[92-df-contradiction]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"fact"},{"key":"book","html":"Gödel's Incompleteness Theorems"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"92"},{"key":"label","html":"92-fact-consistency-pi1"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>92-fact-consistency-pi1</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"fact-consistency-pi1 — The Selected Consistency Sentence Is Pi_1"},{"key":"source","html":"第 IX 章 p. 108（PDF 125）；层级按本地定义"},{"key":"source_status","html":"原书内容的显式重构"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"68f172d58c15e75d\" href=\"?note=68f172d58c15e75d\" title=\"92-df-consistency-statement\">92-df-consistency-statement</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"140342deea557884\" href=\"?note=140342deea557884\" title=\"92-df-pi1-formula\">92-df-pi1-formula</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"076e69cbf2d46206\" href=\"?note=076e69cbf2d46206\" title=\"92-fact-provability-sigma1\">92-fact-provability-sigma1</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"8bd18c4d476f594a\" href=\"?note=8bd18c4d476f594a\" title=\"92-df-formula-instance\">92-df-formula-instance</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"0dd7c9b3e61cc21b\" href=\"?note=0dd7c9b3e61cc21b\" title=\"92-df-contradiction\">92-df-contradiction</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Con}_G\">\\(\\mathrm{Con}_G\\)</span> 是选定内部一致性句；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Prov}_G(v_0)\\in\\Sigma_1^G\">\\(\\mathrm{Prov}_G(v_0)\\in\\Sigma_1^G\\)</span> 如上游结果。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\bot_G\">\\(\\bot_G\\)</span> 为固定矛盾句，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\bar n\">\\(\\bar n\\)</span> 为数码；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Pi_1^G\">\\(\\Pi_1^G\\)</span> 为第一全称层。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{fact\\text{-}consistency\\text{-}pi1}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Con}_G=\\neg\\mathrm{Prov}_G(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\bot_G\\urcorner})\n\\land\\mathrm{Con}_G\\in\\Pi_1^G.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{fact\\text{-}consistency\\text{-}pi1}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Con}_G=\\neg\\mathrm{Prov}_G(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\bot_G\\urcorner})\n\\land\\mathrm{Con}_G\\in\\Pi_1^G.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>把闭数码代入 Σ₁ 公式仍为 Σ₁，再取否定得到 Π₁。此层级事实不要求外部一致性；当系统不一致时该句可为假，却仍在相同复杂度层。外部 Con(G) 是元语言性质，不是这里的公式。</p>\n<p>原书定位：第 IX 章 p. 108（PDF 125）；层级按本地定义。页码同时给出印刷页与 PDF 页；所有公式均为本地重构。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"92-df-consistency-statement","status":"resolved","id":"68f172d58c15e75d","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-consistency-statement]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-pi1-formula","status":"resolved","id":"140342deea557884","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnc